    script)
  - [1mUntouched:[0m [38;5;153msrc/index.js[39m, [38;5;153msrc/utils.js[39m — the Node side is unrelated to this

  Does this look right? Flag anything you'd change, particularly the [38;5;153mwindow.Preferences[39m + CommonJS choice in section 1
  and the single-blob layout in section 2 — those are the two decisions that are more annoying to reverse later. Once
